            <ArticleTitle>The dietary prevention and treatment of coronary heart disease in the new millennium.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>276-82</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Dietary changes can reduce the risk of coronary artery disease by 50%-70%. By understanding the mechanism, we can begin explaining why coronary heart disease has been the leading cause of mortality in most industrialized nations over the last century.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
